{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06928","headline":"客有自燕而归哀其老而赠之 · 常建","name":"客有自燕而归哀其老而赠之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羸马朝自燕，一身爲二连。\n忆亲拜孤冢，移葬双陵前。\n幽愿从此毕，劒心因获全。\n孟冬寒气盛，抚辔告言旋。\n碣石海北门，余寇惟朝鲜。\n离离一寒骑，嫋嫋驰白天。\n生别皆自取，况爲士卒先。\n寸心渔阳兴，落日旌竿悬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}